mksi-q4-2018-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"MKSI 2018 Q4","e":"mksi","d":"2019-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gerald G. Colella","x":"And we have tried for years to convince our customers to move away from MRP and long-term contracting and schedule deliveries to rightsize supply because it just is consistent and just it takes all the forecasting concern out of it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/mks-instruments-inc-mksi-q4-2018-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"MKSI 2019 Q2","e":"mksi","d":"2019-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Gerald G. Colella","x":"This is primarily due to disruption of the global trade environment highlighted by softening in consumer electronic devices, tariffs and the Huawei ban.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/mks-instruments-inc-mksi-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"MKSI 2019 Q2","e":"mksi","d":"2019-07-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Gerald G. Colella","x":"We're not interested in low-end, low technology commodity pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/mks-instruments-inc-mksi-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"MKSI 2019 Q2","e":"mksi","d":"2019-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Seth H. Bagshaw","x":"GAAP operating expenses were $147 million, included $17.6 million in amortization of tangible assets, $3.2 million in acquisition integration costs and $1.2 million in restructuring costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/mks-instruments-inc-mksi-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"MKSI 2019 Q2","e":"mksi","d":"2019-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Seth H. Bagshaw","x":"…of intangible assets is expected to be approximately $17.2 million, integration related costs expected to be approximately $1.7 million, restructuring cost estimated at $1.8 million, interest income is expected at $1.2 million and GAAP interest expense estimated to be approximately $11.6 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/mks-instruments-inc-mksi-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"MKSI 2019 Q3","e":"mksi","d":"2019-10-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John T.C. Lee","x":"And we're actually pretty happy with that given all the uncertainty in the -- the tariff wars and the macro economic kind of issues.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/mks-instruments-inc-mksi-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"MKSI 2019 Q3","e":"mksi","d":"2019-10-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John T.C. Lee","x":"So I think our view is that it's mostly constrained by the geopolitical issues and the trade war.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/mks-instruments-inc-mksi-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"MKSI 2019 Q3","e":"mksi","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Seth H. Bagshaw","x":"GAAP operating expenses were $138 million and include $17 million in amortization of tangible assets, $2.1 million in acquisition and integration costs, $1.5 million in restructuring costs and $600,000 of transaction fees associated with the repricing of our term loan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/mks-instruments-inc-mksi-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"MKSI 2019 Q3","e":"mksi","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Seth H. Bagshaw","x":"In addition, we recorded a $6.8 million gain from the sale of certain real estate holdings as we continue to streamline our geographic footprint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/mks-instruments-inc-mksi-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"MKSI 2019 Q4","e":"mksi","d":"2020-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John T.C. Lee","x":"But it hasn't really gone backward -- back in terms of the original -- removal of tariffs back to original levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/0