management","s":"John T. C. Lee","x":"And as Seth mentioned, price increases that we're working through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/mks-instruments-inc-mksi-q2-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"MKSI 2021 Q2","e":"mksi","d":"2021-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John T. C. Lee","x":"But I think we maintain the guidance range to be a little higher than normal, but the same as Q2 just because of that uncertainty.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/mks-instruments-inc-mksi-q2-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"MKSI 2021 Q3","e":"mksi","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Krish Sankar","x":"And I understand its hard for you to increase price for your semi customers, maybe they pay for shipping, but not for product price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/mks-instruments-inc-mksi-q3-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"MKSI 2021 Q3","e":"mksi","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Krish Sankar","x":"But are you doing any price increase on the Advanced Market side where you have a longer tail of customers?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/mks-instruments-inc-mksi-q3-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"MKSI 2025 Q4","e":"mksi","d":"2026-02-18","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"John Lee","x":"So I think the customers and our customers' customers are putting a lot of the investments in DRAM, obviously, for AI, and that's causing this crunch in terms of availability of memory.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/mks-mksi-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MKSI 2025 Q4","e":"mksi","d":"2026-02-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ramakumar Mayampurath","x":"While margins were down year-over-year, it was a very solid performance given ongoing impact from higher tariffs, higher palladium prices, which are passed through at 0 margins and the effect of higher chemistry equipment in our overall mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/mks-mksi-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MKSI 2025 Q4","e":"mksi","d":"2026-02-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ramakumar Mayampurath","x":"Gross margin was 46.7%, down 90 basis points year-over-year, driven by additional costs related to tariffs and product mix, including record chemistry equipment sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/mks-mksi-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MKSI 2025 Q4","e":"mksi","d":"2026-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John Lee","x":"Excluding the impact of FX and palladium pass-through, the chemistry sales increased 16% in the fourth quarter and 11% for the full year compared to the same periods in 2024, reflecting another year of healthy growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/mks-mksi-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MKSI 2025 Q4","e":"mksi","d":"2026-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ramakumar Mayampurath","x":"Chemistry sales in the quarter were up 16% year-over-year, excluding the impact of FX and palladium pass-through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/mks-mksi-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MKSI 2026 Q1","e":"mksi","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"John Lee","x":"We are in an excellent position to capitalize on chip makers' ambitious AI-driven CapEx plans, which are accelerating technology inflections that enable more complex vertical structures in semiconductor devices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/mks-mksi-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MKSI 2026 Q1","e":"mksi","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ramakumar Mayampurath","x":"As a reminder, Q1 2025 did not include incremental tariff impacts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/mks-mksi-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MKSI 2026 Q1","e":"mksi","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ramakumar Mayampurath","x":"So we are seeing -- so we have neutralized the tariff cost dollar for dollar as we reported earlier.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/mks-mksi-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MKSI 2026 Q1","e":"mksi","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John Lee","x":"Excluding the impact of FX and palladium pass-through, chemistry sales increased 22% year-over-year, driven by AI-related advanced PCB manufacturing and high-end smartphones.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/mks-mksi-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MKSI 2026 Q1","e":"mksi","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ramakumar Mayampurath","x":"Chemistry sales in the quarter were up 22% year-over-year, excluding the impact of FX and palladium pass-through, underscoring the accelerating demand from AI-related applications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/mks-mksi-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MKSI 2026 Q2","e":"mksi","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"John Lee","x":"Against the backdrop of intensifying AI-driven investment across semiconductor and advanced packaging applications, we are demonstrating the strength of our foundational position, from vacuum, plasma and power products that enable leading-edge etch and deposition applications, to optical…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/mks-mksi-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MKSI 2026 Q2","e":"mksi","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"John Lee","x":"AI-related applications are driving a meaningful increase in investment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/mks-mksi-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MKSI 2026 Q2","e":"mksi","d":"2026-08-06","l":"tariffs",